flowchart TD
    Situations(("`⚡ **Situations**`"))
    Variables[("`**Variables**
    market size
    price sensitivity
    base costs`")]

    Start([Round start])
    Agent[Agent decisions]
    State[("`**Company state**
    cash
    capacity
    brand
    models
    research`")]
    Compute["`**Market & cash update**
    share
    revenue
    burn`"]
    Check{Continue?}
    EndN([End])

    Start --> Agent --> State --> Compute --> Check
    Check -->|no| Start
    Check -->|yes| EndN

    Situations -.->|modify| Variables
    Variables -.->|read| Compute
    Situations -.->|modify| State
